abstract: >-
  Reproducible EU27 country-year panel with country and year fixed effects,
  country-and-year clustered inference, 656 baseline observations, 12 panel
  specifications, independent statistical checks, automated manuscript assets,
  and a preserved Spanish institutional case study and 13 national regressions.
